{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#card-zh","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 Windows 桌面提供截图和鼠标键盘控制。它通过 Cordis 注册 computer_* 工具，并在 Web 插件设置中提供视觉模型配置及总开关。主要功能包括截屏、点击拖动滚动、输入文本与快捷键、等待界面更新，以及调用用户配置的视觉模型描述截图。适合希望让 DSH 操作 Windows 应用或读取屏幕内容的用户。基础控制不需额外账号；视觉观察需配置 HTTPS 视觉模型地址、API Key 和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:49-179","src/index.ts:13-34","src/vision.ts:30-47"]}
{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#card-en","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Computer Use adds Windows desktop control to DSH: take screenshots, click, type, and use optional vision analysis. Vision sends screenshots to a configured HTTPS model and requires its API key; basic controls need no account.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:49-179","src/index.ts:13-34","src/vision.ts:30-47"]}
