{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#feature-1","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「桌面截图」：捕获 Windows 虚拟桌面并保存为 DSH 图片附件，返回截图尺寸和图片供后续查看。调用 computer_screenshot 触发，截图尺寸受配置上限约束。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:49-72"]}
{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#feature-2","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「鼠标操作」：computer_click、computer_drag 和 computer_scroll 可点击、拖动或滚动 Windows 桌面，并校验坐标与输入范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:74-111"]}
{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#feature-3","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「键盘输入」：通过 computer_type 输入 Unicode 文本，或用 computer_keypress 发送支持的按键组合。文本长度和按键会先校验，组合键作用于当前焦点控件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:114-145"]}
{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#feature-4","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「视觉观察」：computer_observe 截取桌面，并将截图与提示词发送到用户配置的视觉模型端点，返回模型描述。启用前需配置 HTTPS 地址、密钥和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:74-72"]}
{"unit_id":"ThreeBody6666__dsh-computer-use#caveat-1","repo":"ThreeBody6666/dsh-computer-use","commit":"b53443b7a9f7d197eb27f0283442ea0fe2c49bb9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 使用 computer_observe 时会把当前桌面截图和提示词发送到用户配置的 HTTPS 视觉模型端点；基础截图及输入操作不调用该端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/vision.ts:30-43"]}
